+### 5. Current Producer-to-Consumer Behavior
+
+```text
+daemon Message/Part event
+  -> GlobalEvent SSE
+  -> SDK event queue
+  -> SyncProvider reducer
+  -> local Message/Part projection
+  -> Markdown/Code renderable
+  -> TreeSitterClient mutation
+  -> ParserWorker persistent Tree
+```
+
+存在两个已证实的owner断裂：
